"The Palace of Unbreaking is a zealous Artonan institution that preserves wordchains."
"It holds that wordchains are the original magic and keeps fragile chains alive by use."
"It restricts fragile chains to responsible users and receives their chain ledgers."
"Among Avowed only Chainers may work there; Artonan members teach once past the novice echelons."
"Its members won't bestow a chain on anyone unwilling."
"Its saying: 'We all make sacrifices for the Unbreaking.'"
"It keeps tomes of chains, some written before Artonan lingual unification, read aloud to Chainers."
"It gives Chainers' students ledgers, silver chain links and Opposite stones."
"The Grand Senate has affirmed its value; some of the strongest chains exist only through it."
"Lute Velra works there for the wizard Parethat-uur, who can force others' chains due."
"The Art'h family has a relationship with the Palace."
